// Keep the complete transitive build/test graph on current releases even
// when upstream modules (google.golang.org/grpc, k8s.io/apiserver,
// open-policy-agent/cert-controller, spf13/cobra, golang.org/x/tools,
// google/pprof, etc.) still declare older minimum versions in their own
// go.mod. None of these packages are imported by this module directly
// (verified with `go mod why`); the replace directives only raise the
// resolved version, they do not change which code is compiled.
